      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Credentials to create\n- **Extractor API key** (Header Auth): name `X-API-Key`, value = `EXTRACTOR_API_KEY` from `.env`\n- **Mailpit** (SMTP): host `mailpit`, port `1025`, any user and password, SSL off",
